'''Vampire's Axe''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife originally obtainable by purchasing the 20th tier in the Main Event for 98,000 [[Candies (2024)|Candies]]{{Currency|Candies2024|25px}} during the [[Halloween Event 2024|2024 Halloween Event]]. This item is now now only obtainable through trading since the event has ended.

==Appearance==
It is a red double-sided axe with sharp golden reflections spreading throughout the Red Edges and a wrapped red handle. It has a Vampire theme, being the last item obtainable from the 2024 Halloween battlepass. The leaderboard prize is a recolored version of this axe, like previous events. Top 3 collectors have a unique version of this axe, while top 100 collectors received a retextured version from the original design.  

==Trivia==
*It is the ninth ancient weapon to be obtained by purchasing the final tier in an event, the others being [[Elderwood Scythe]], [[Logchopper]], [[Hallowscythe]], [[Icebreaker]], [[Harvester]], [[Icepiercer]], [[Traveler's Axe]], [[Swirly Axe]], [[Gingerscope]] and [[Celestial]]
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Vampire's Gun]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Vampire's_Set Vampire's Set].
*It is also part of the Full Vampire's set, along with [[Vampire's Edge]], and the [[Vampire (Radio)|Vampire]] Radio.
*It partners with the [[Vampiric (Effect)|Vampiric]] effect, which is obtainable from the Halloween 2024 battlepass.
*There is a [[Gold Vampire's Axe|gold]], [[Silver Vampire's Axe|silver]], [[Bronze Vampire's Axe|bronze]], and [[Purple Vampire's Axe|purple]] variant of this knife.

